            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695990101",
                    "speaker": "Ororon",
                    "text": "Does everyone else pick the cards in their decks? Hmm, I always have a hard time deciding, so I have to ask some animals for advice."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6959902",
            "initDialog": "695990201",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695990201",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "Let's play Genius Invokation TCG."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6959903",
            "initDialog": "695990301",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695990301",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "I've got other things to do right now..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "695990302",
                    "speaker": "Ororon",
                    "text": "Goodbye. Would you like to meet the flying squirrels who helped me pick my cards? They're amazing."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6959904",
            "initDialog": "695990401",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695990401",
                    "speaker": "Ororon",
                    "text": "I need to thank the little animals who helped me choose my cards. Is that strange? Sorry, we Masters of the Night-Wind rely on luck to do things."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6959905",
            "initDialog": "695990501",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695990501",
                    "speaker": "Ororon",
                    "text": "Granny always says my deck is a \"complete potato of a deck,\" and it looks like she's right as usual."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6959906",
            "initDialog": "695990601",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695990601",
                    "speaker": "Ororon",
                    "text": "Cards? Sure, give me a sec. A Qucusaurus flew off with a few of my nicest-looking cards earlier, so I need to find a way to fill out the deck..."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6959908",
            "initDialog": "695990801",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695990801",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "Let's play Genius Invokation TCG."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6959909",
            "initDialog": "695990901",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695990901",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "Let me adjust my deck first..."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6959910",
            "initDialog": "695991001",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695991001",
                    "speaker": "Ororon",
                    "text": "#Wait, I actually won like that? You're not just humoring me, are you, {M#Gramps}{F#other Granny}?"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6959911",
            "initDialog": "695991101",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695991101",
                    "speaker": "Ororon",
                    "text": "*sigh* Cacucu didn't like this card. I should have replaced it. I'm sorry, Cacucu."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6959912",
            "initDialog": "695991201",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695991201",
                    "speaker": "Ororon",
                    "text": "Sure. Sometimes I play cards with the Iktomisaurus Elder. I usually lose because it hides its cards."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6959914",
            "initDialog": "695991401",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695991401",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "Let's play Genius Invokation TCG."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6959915",
            "initDialog": "695991501",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695991501",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "Let me adjust my deck first..."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6959916",
            "initDialog": "695991601",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695991601",
                    "speaker": "Ororon",
                    "text": "I'm glad you let me win a round. Thank you."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6959917",
            "initDialog": "695991701",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695991701",
                    "speaker": "Ororon",
                    "text": "You're just as good as Granny, but unlike her, you don't take back moves. That makes you an even better player."
                }
            ]
        },
